# Wave T28 (Fairhaven kit): quayfloor — Fairhaven's registered street
# kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the
# desire-path tiers key on it). RUNNING-BOND quay stone: two courses
# of long sandstone slabs, half-offset (course joints at x8, then
# x4/x12), tar-dark seams, pale worn faces — a harbour quay, not a
# plaza grid. Structurally offset bond + tar seams, not a recolour:
# Copperton's are big SQUARE quarry flags in a grid, Mistford's are
# long timber planks, Cinder's small brick, Redwood's gravel
# speckle. The bond offset reads at screenshot scale.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T28-FAIRHAVEN-PLAN.md.)
